r(--color-indigo)] [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_sub]:text-[0.75em] [&amp;_sup]:text-[0.75em] [&amp;_sub]:relative [&amp;_sup]:relative [&amp;_sub]:[line-height:0] [&amp;_sup]:[line-height:0] [&amp;_h1]:text-left [&amp;_h1]:text-[var(--color-ink)] [&amp;_h2]:text-left [&amp;_h2]:text-[var(--color-ink)] [&amp;_h3]:text-left [&amp;_h3]:text-[var(--color-ink)] [&amp;_h4]:text-left [&amp;_h4]:text-[var(--color-ink)]\"><p>This paragraph flows beside the floated image above (legacy float behaviour must be unchanged).</p></div></section><figure><div class=\"aspect-video overflow-hidden rounded-md bg-black w-[85%] mx-auto\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/dQw4w9WgXcQ\" title=\"A video\" class=\"h-full w-full\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowFullScreen=\"\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-presentation\"></iframe></div><figcaption class=\"mt-1.5 text-xs text-[var(--color-ink-faint)]\">A video</figcaption></figure><p class=\"rounded-md bg-[var(--color-paper)] px-4 py-3 text-center text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-[var(--color-ink)]\">SO<sub>4</sub><sup>2</sup>- + 2H<sup>+</sup> -&gt; H<sub>2</sub>SO<sub>4</sub></p><div class=\"rounded-md border-l-4 border-[#6d8cff] bg-[#6d8cff]/12 p-4\"><p class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#8da3ff]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-lightbulb\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 14c.2-1 .7-1.7 1.5-2.5 1-.9 1.5-2.2 1.5-3.5A6 6 0 0 0 6 8c0 1 .2 2.2 1.5 3.5.7.7 1.3 1.5 1.5 2.5\"></path><path d=\"M9 18h6\"></path><path d=\"M10 22h4\"></path></svg> Key Idea</p><p class=\"mt-1.5 text-sm text-[var(--color-ink)]\"><span class=\"\">Relative atomic mass is a weighted average of isotope masses.</span></p></div><div class=\"rounded-md border border-[#2dd4bf]/35 bg-[#2dd4bf]/10 p-4\"><p class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#45e0cd]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-book-marked\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 2v8l3-3 3 3V2\"></path><path d=\"M4 19.5v-15A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 2H19a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v18a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H6.5a1 1 0 0 1 0-5H20\"></path></svg> Definition</p><p class=\"mt-1.5 font-semibold text-[var(--color-ink)]\"><span class=\"\">Isotope</span></p><p class=\"mt-0.5 text-sm text-[var(--color-ink)]\"><span class=\"\">Atoms of one element with different mass numbers.</span></p></div><div class=\"rounded-md border-l-4 border-[#f59e0b] bg-[#f59e0b]/10 p-4\"><p class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#f7b94a]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-triangle-alert\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg> Common Mistakes / Misunderstandings</p><p class=\"mt-1.5 text-sm text-[var(--color-ink)]\"><span class=\"\">Mass number is not the same as relative atomic mass.</span></p></div><div class=\"rounded-md border border-[#34d399]/30 bg-[#34d399]/10 p-4 after:block after:clear-both after:content-[&#x27;&#x27;]\"><p class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#5ee0ad]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-earth\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21.54 15H17a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v4.54\"></path><path d=\"M7 3.34V5a3 3 0 0 0 3 3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2c0 1.1.9 2 2 2a2 2 0 0 0 2-2c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h3.17\"></path><path d=\"M11 21.95V18a2 2 0 0 0-2-2a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-1a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H2.05\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle></svg> Real-Life Connection</p><p class=\"mt-1.5 font-semibold text-[var(--color-ink)]\">Carbon dating</p><figure class=\"my-2 w-full sm:w-[30%] sm:float-left sm:mr-5\"><img src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7\" alt=\"c\" class=\"h-auto w-full rounded-md\"/></figure><p class=\"mt-0.5 text-justify text-sm leading-relaxed text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\"><span class=\"\">Uses carbon-14.</span></p></div><div class=\"rounded-md border border-[#fb7185]/30 bg-[#fb7185]/10 p-4\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#ff8fa1]\">Worked Example</p><p class=\"mt-1.5 text-sm font-medium text-[var(--color-ink)]\"><span class=\"\">Calculate Ar of chlorine.</span></p><p class=\"mt-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[var(--color-ink-faint)]\">Solution</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[var(--color-ink-soft)] first:mt-0\"><span class=\"\">(35 x 75 + 37 x 25) / 100 = 35.5</span></p></div><div class=\"rounded-md border border-[#fb7185]/30 bg-[#fb7185]/10 p-4\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#ff8fa1]\">Worked Example</p><div class=\"mt-1.5 text-sm font-medium text-[var(--color-ink)]\"><p class=\"mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[var(--color-ink-soft)] first:mt-0\"><span class=\"\">Q</span></p></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"mt-3 rounded-md bg-[var(--color-indigo)] px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-white\">Show Solution</button></div><div class=\"rounded-md border border-[#22d3ee]/30 bg-[#22d3ee]/10 p-4\"><p class=\"font-semibold text-[var(--color-ink)]\">Data</p><div class=\"mt-3 overflow-x-auto\"><table class